        "synopsis": {
            "value": "\"Sesanghan Samhyeongje\" explores the lives of three brothers and their marriages. Keong-kang (Ahn Nae-Sang) is the eldest son, who remarries at the chagrin of his father Sun-kyeong (Park In-Hwan). Middle son Hyeon-chal (Oh Dae-Gyu) is the pride of the family, with several successful businesses, but suffers with a less than ideal marriage. Youngest son Lee-sang (Lee Jun-Hyeok) follows in his father's footsteps by becoming a police officer, but raises the ire of his father by marrying the daughter of a bitter foe.",
